  Before I touch it — this is a breaking change to a published contract, not an internal rename. [38;5;153mREADME.md[39m names three
  consumers of [38;5;153mGET /users[39m (the web app, iOS 3.2+, and the nightly partner export) and states that response field names
  are part of the contract, with changes going through a versioned endpoint. Renaming in place makes [38;5;153muserId[39m disappear
  for every existing client; the iOS clients in particular can't be updated in lockstep.

  So I'm stopping here rather than editing.

